## 3. Real-Time Telemetry, Behavioral Analytics & User Retention Funnels

### 3.1 Overcoming the "Black Box" Problem: Capturing Action-Level Event Telemetry

A primary frustration for traditional software developers entering the GPT Store is the **"Black Box" Problem**: OpenAI does not provide builders with raw chat transcripts, individual user session recordings, or granular token usage graphs inside the default ChatGPT interface. Builders are provided only with aggregate weekly active user counts and a star rating.

To build an enterprise-grade commercial product, developers must engineer an **External Telemetry Pipeline** utilizing GPT Actions.

